# A party buff on a timer in GMS, at 5+x attack, 5+x magic attack and 30x
# DEF. There is no party and nothing runs out here, so the Cleric simply keeps
# it -- the same treatment the other two wizards' Meditation gets.
#
# This is the Cleric's whole magic attack: they have no Meditation, so where
# the other wizards end on +30 this ends on +15. The attack is granted as well
# because GMS grants it, though a magician swings on the other number.
name: "Bless"
skill_order: 4
description:
  "A blessing spoken over your own head. Increases Attack Power, Magic Attack "
  "and DEF."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC
max_level: 10
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Invincible"
  level: 5
}
base {
  attack: 6
  magic_attack: 6
  def: 30
}
per_level {
  attack: 1
  magic_attack: 1
  def: 30
}
